# text = Goddard's , her evil stars had led her to the very spot where , at that moment , a trunk , directed to _The Rev . Philip Elton , White-Hart , Bath_ , was to be seen under the operation of being lifted into the butcher's cart , which was to convey it to where the coaches past ; and every thing in this world , excepting that trunk and the direction , was consequently a blank .
